Builds libcubwt 1.0.0 with CUDA 13 for sm_120: sm_120 in the architecture list, and cub::Sum/Max/Min
replaced for CCCL 3, as libcubwt 1.6.1 and 1.6.2 did. libcubwt is Copyright (c) Ilya Grebnov and
licensed under the Apache License 2.0; this patch is under the same license.
Apply in a libcubwt 1.0.0 checkout with: git apply libcubwt-1.0.0-cuda13.patch

